{"title":"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of three consecutive integers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/c/b1cb5bdce2d06d2419066a2b55ab01d824217bd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$54$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"18\" height=\"13\" />. What is the smallest of the three integers?\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Call the smallest integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/4/b0495af1d7b094561fcade343847d464778c925d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" /> . Thus two other consecutive integers will be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> , <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/c/cccb103143393c0119f5ab61d6d53a852ce70fcf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" />.\nNow according to question, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/9/089fddcc0ebfecb679253f64fef3c00c9593b711.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - 1 + x + x + 1 = 54$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"182\" height=\"15\" /> solving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/d/e3d3e4315e912987aa3b30ed98d1a76b68101997.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"55\" height=\"14\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II\">2015 UNCO Math Contest II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://uncmathcontest.wordpress.com/\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2015 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 10\">10</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_Northern_Colorado_Math_Contest\" title=\"University of Northern Colorado Math Contest\"> All UNCO Math Contest Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017045609\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.015 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.020 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 84/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1363/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 100/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1059/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.991      1 Template:UNCO_Math_Contest_box\n100.00%    6.991      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key w